{
    "title": "Lowes Foods",
    "description": "Download our new and improved app so that you have the best of Lowes Foods in the palm of your hand! Enjoy instant access to Lowes Foods to Go \u2013 our life-changing online grocery pickup and delivery service \u2013 along with all of the benefits of our Fresh Rewards program. You\u2019ll also enjoy exclusive discounts and offers that you won\u2019t find anywhere else! \r\nSimply download the new app, log in, and start enjoying all of the great things you love as well as new features to make it even easier for you to enjoy Lowes Foods: \r\n\r\n-\tNew! You will be able to see a product\u2019s aisle or department within your preferred store when viewing the product\u2019s description page, making building lists and shopping in store even faster. \r\n-\tNew! Easy enrollment and renewal make Annual Subscriptions easier than ever \u2013 and always $49, no matter when you renew! \r\n-\tNew! A new barcode scanner allows you to scan any item to get details, nutrition, photos, store location, and add it to your order.\r\n-\tNew! The savings tracker will help you maximize savings through digital coupons and promotions. You can clip weekly Digital Coupons directly to your account and watch your savings grow in store and online.\r\n-\tNew! An improved Order Status feature will help you track the progress of \u2013 and even edit \u2013 your order, so you can plan your schedule better.\r\n-\tEasily re-order your favorite items any time you need them. \r\n-\tBe a \u201cmeal hero\u201d with our exclusive recipes featuring interactive ingredients.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Download our new and improved app so that you have the best of Lowes Foods in the palm of your hand! Enjoy instant access to Lowes Foods to Go \u2013 our life-changing online grocery pickup and delivery service \u2013 along with all of the benefits of our Fresh Rewards program. You\u2019ll also enjoy exclusive discounts and offers that you won\u2019t find anywhere else! <br>Simply download the new app, log in, and start enjoying all of the great things you love as well as new features to make it even easier for you to enjoy Lowes Foods: <br><br>-\tNew! You will be able to see a product\u2019s aisle or department within your preferred store when viewing the product\u2019s description page, making building lists and shopping in store even faster. <br>-\tNew! Easy enrollment and renewal make Annual Subscriptions easier than ever \u2013 and always $49, no matter when you renew! <br>-\tNew! A new barcode scanner allows you to scan any item to get details, nutrition, photos, store location, and add it to your order.<br>-\tNew! The savings tracker will help you maximize savings through digital coupons and promotions. You can clip weekly Digital Coupons directly to your account and watch your savings grow in store and online.<br>-\tNew! An improved Order Status feature will help you track the progress of \u2013 and even edit \u2013 your order, so you can plan your schedule better.<br>-\tEasily re-order your favorite items any time you need them. <br>-\tBe a \u201cmeal hero\u201d with our exclusive recipes featuring interactive ingredients.",
